            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "How Morningstar\u2019s ChatGPT Integration With PitchBook (MORN) Has Changed Its Investment Story",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "In December 2025, Morningstar, Inc. and its subsidiary PitchBook launched new apps within OpenAI\u2019s ChatGPT, allowing entitled users to access their research, data, and ratings through natural-language prompts with enterprise-grade security. This integration advances Morningstar\u2019s ambition to serve as an \u201cintelligence layer\u201d for investing by embedding its public and private markets insights directly into widely used AI workflows. Next, we\u2019ll examine how embedding Morningstar and PitchBook...",
